Step 1: GitHub repository open pannu
Un GitHub repository GitExperiment1-ku po.
Code tab click pannu.
Branch dropdown-la main select pannu.
Idhu mudinjadhum next step pannu.
Step 2: Pudhu branch create pannu
main branch dropdown click pannu.
Search box-la feature2 nu type pannu.
Create branch: feature2 from main nu varum; adha click pannu.
Ippo feature2 branch create aagidum.
Step 3: Pudhu file create pannu
feature2 branch-la irukkiya-nu check pannittu:
Add file click pannu.
Create new file select pannu.
File name box-la idhai type pannu:
feature2_demo.txt
File content-la idhai type pannu:
Feature 2 implementation completed
Commit changes click pannu.
Commit message-a default-ah irukkattum.
Commit directly to the feature2 branch select pannu.
Commit changes click pannu.
Ippo pudhu file feature2 branch-la save aagidum.
Step 4: Pull Request create pannu
Repository-la Pull requests tab click pannu.
New pull request click pannu.
Branch selection ippadi irukkanum:
Base: main
Compare: feature2
Create pull request click pannu.
Title-la idhai kodu:
Merge feature2 into main
Marubadiyum Create pull request click pannu.
Step 5: Feature branch merge pannu
Merge pull request click pannu.
Confirm merge click pannu.
Merge successful message varum.
Step 6: Merge verify pannu
Code tab-ku po.
Branch dropdown-la main select pannu.
Files list-la feature2_demo.txt irukka-nu paaru.
File open panni content check pannu.
Feature 2 implementation completed nu irundha, merge successful! ✅
